## Scope

This repository is dual-licensed. The MIT terms above cover the **code**:

    packages/**            engine (integrity, scoring, bootstrap, anchoring)
    apps/**                ingest jobs and the web application
    public-mirror/*.mjs    dependency-free verifiers
    public-mirror/*.py     the Python chain verifier
    .github/**             workflows
    *.json, *.js, *.ts     configuration at the repository root

The **data and prose documentation** are licensed separately under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International. See [LICENSE-DATA](LICENSE-DATA)
for what that covers and how to attribute it.

Where a file could be read as falling under both — this file's own reference to
"associated documentation files" being the obvious case — the split above
governs: code is MIT, data and prose are CC BY 4.0.
